{
  "Welcome to Déjà Vu. This is a short demo, and it plays by itself. You’ll follow Alex, a parent in Chicago, who asks an agent for help with everyday plans. Like most agents today, this one remembers Alex through a summary it wrote from past chats. Alex never gets to see that summary.": "08875875db91.m4a",
  "It’s a Tuesday morning, and Alex wants to plan winter break for the whole family: Alex, Sam, their daughter Maya, and Biscuit the dog.": "3508a17c9b8e.m4a",
  "A reasonable answer. But let’s look at what the agent was given. Tap the info button. It was sent a summary about Alex, with every message. Alex can’t see it, check it, or fix it.": "75f8954a5a6e.m4a",
  "Now Alex turns on Déjà Vu. It asks first. Then it reads Alex’s past chats once and writes short cards, one fact each. One Muse model writes them, and another grades them. Every card stays a guess until Alex says it’s right.": "35bfb8de7384.m4a",
  "Same question, in a fresh chat. This time the agent gets only the few cards that fit the question.": "d0024fe54c91.m4a",
  "Open the info button again. These are the exact cards it used, and the tokens it really sent. Under the answer, one short line checks the guess this plan leans on most.": "fe22814ba718.m4a",
  "Alex used to love warm beaches, but that’s changed. Your turn: tap Not anymore.": "2aefe462d215.m4a",
  "Now tell it what’s true, in one tap.": "d4104220c7aa.m4a",
  "The plan updates right away, and the card is fixed for next time. And nothing was booked without Alex saying so.": "83493aff350f.m4a",
  "Now a small question. Nothing is at stake here, so Déjà Vu doesn’t interrupt with a check. It only asks when it matters.": "3d41c916dec4.m4a",
  "Everything the agent knows about Alex lives in Memory, sorted by topic. Flip any card to see the exact chat it came from.": "123357a75ee2.m4a",
  "Checking cards is quick. Swipe right if it’s still true, and left if it isn’t.": "c87d56adb273.m4a",
  "Or just say what’s true now, in your own words. Both cards update and are marked confirmed. That’s Déjà Vu: memory Alex can see, check, and fix.": "f75b45940388.m4a",
